[{"title":"赠孙炎","author":"汪广洋","text":"拜命趋侯府，持书出省曹。\n宦游千里外，公论一时高。\n晓日鸣珂佩，晴天簇羽旄。\n暂为东楚别，且醉太平皋。\n祖席陈麟脯，宾筵集凤毛。\n清歌来窈窕，名酒挹葡萄。\n好奋云中鹄，须持海上鳌。\n赠言良在耳，极意对挥毫。\n野色薰青草，澜光滟碧桃。\n徘徊瞻鹊喜，彷佛及蚕缫。\n畴昔成戎服，陪行拥战艘。\n每同登虎帐，恒得进龙韬。\n况复膺新宠，休云任独劳。\n汉廷思贾谊，晋室望山涛。\n多事烦经济，群情慰郁陶。\n抚摩深见托，佐理未为叨。\n周道期回辙，强弓拟载櫜。\n豺狼终见化，蜂虿亦何逃。\n陋巷腾欢笑，交衢绝恸号。\n九华应远待，飞翠照恩袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53482,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蔡元善之官铜陵","author":"汪广洋","text":"白面黄华使，朱衣紫府仙。\n仪容追典雅，进退合周旋。\n捧檄长观国，宣威每到边。\n风尘双鬓㡳，江汉一帆前。\n上相怜多艺，诸公念独贤。\n铜陵开旧治，玉案喜新迁。\n拜命兼恩宠，躬行在勉㫋。\n好扳潘岳驾，莫后祖生鞭。\n旦日催鸣佩，春华簇舞筵。\n从来枳棘地，鸾凤岂留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53483,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章南楼","author":"汪广洋","text":"适意缘清景，驰思属早秋。\n眷焉临胜地，暂尔憩南楼。\n楚岫云中出，章江树杪流。\n凉蝉汎声响，细草没归愁。\n鼓角三边壮，襜帷五月留。\n谁知放歌者，脉脉寄沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53484,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忠勤楼诸老夜直余时守省作诗寄之 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"画省夜不寤，起行双树间。\n遥闻唳孤鹤，清响落空山。\n凉露徐徐下，秋云故故还。\n从来事幽览，颇与意相关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53485,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小孤山","author":"汪广洋","text":"海门第一关，苍翠五云间。\n阴雨蛟龙出，晴天鹳鹤还。\n江声舂夜寂，草色带春殷。\n欲往临危顶，因之望故山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53486,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登徐孺子亭","author":"汪广洋","text":"高士不可得，兹亭幸尔留。\n偶来当暇日，况复及清秋。\n湖水当门落，松云傍枕浮。\n几时閒历览，乘月放扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53487,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西掖闻莺","author":"汪广洋","text":"粉署春已晚，黄鹂时复鸣。\n落花荡轻吹，繁木翳新晴。\n好语多联续，馀音入紫清。\n凤凰池上客，一曲送新声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53488,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清风亭对酒","author":"汪广洋","text":"二月雨中尽，一尊亭下开。\n青山望不极，白云招可来。\n啼鸟合芳树，落花委苍苔。\n遥知旧游者，歌咏凤凰台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53489,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日忆故园","author":"汪广洋","text":"素得故园趣，远如南涧阿。\n众芳时既集，啼鸟秋复多。\n对竹不及晦，酌酒屡当歌。\n去乡仅十载，怀之可奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53490,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋秋日","author":"汪广洋","text":"帷幕公事简，斋居文墨閒。\n开帘坐白日，拄笏对青山。\n谬拙占微宦，疏慵觉厚颜。\n空令怀旧业，心逐鸟飞还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53491,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归耕叟","author":"汪广洋","text":"轩冕若为累，田园信可耕。\n宁知静者意，不类旷达情。\n过江逢雨歇，穿林闻鸟鸣。\n得酒亦复醉，陶然终此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53492,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋树","author":"汪广洋","text":"墙头两好树，翠碧积阴阴。\n落日风涛起，满庭秋意深。\n繁条委砌石，凉叶下衣襟。\n况有行歌者，闻之亦散心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53493,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登凤凰台怀孙伯融","author":"汪广洋","text":"故人不可见，远怀良未开。\n烟树暮云合，江帆春雨来。\n含情望三益，抚卷歌七哀。\n聊以酒一斗，携上凤凰台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53494,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征妇词","author":"汪广洋","text":"夫当戍关塞，妾重事姑嫜。\n见月惊离别，裁衣欲寄将。\n泪先金剪落，心逐茧丝长。\n想得仓庚语，归时日载阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬叶汇","author":"汪广洋","text":"子独抱远器，澹然陶至情。\n素无圭组系，缅有林壑情。\n园涉爱嘉树，觞咏掇芳英。\n余亦忘机者，世纷非所婴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿浦江钱氏山居 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"乔木苍然者，如君有几家。\n安居忘岁月，适意在烟霞。\n对客开春酒，当门扫落花。\n万方从战伐，全不废生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53497,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿浦江钱氏山居 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"四壁暮山紫，千章春树齐。\n若人忘世故，筑室住岩西。\n静日看云出，开帘听鸟啼。\n客来携子侄，随意阅新题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53498,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孙伯融之官池阳","author":"汪广洋","text":"江浦晚霞明，桃花春水生。\n来携建业酒，送子池阳城。\n临发赠宝剑，开筵弹玉筝。\n况当理新国，珍重在斯行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53499,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊临江城下","author":"汪广洋","text":"维舟近清樾，坐爱江水深。\n飞雨忽沾席，凉风吹满林。\n当歌发慷慨，访旧纵登临。\n聊以写绿绮，因之清我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53500,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓经豫章城东","author":"汪广洋","text":"忽忽岁年暮，感我去乡思。\n临轩梳短发，缓辔过方池。\n野旷秋云淡，天凉露气滋。\n澹台遗冢在，谁与荐江篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53501,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送栾架阁督运宣徽 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"江色净如洗，白门三月春。\n愁来别知己，况乃是乡人。\n积雨暮云合，东风芳草新。\n宣徽耆旧在，相见重咨询。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53502,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送栾架阁督运宣徽 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"萧何馈饷日，汉业经营时。\n一旦见图绘，千年垂令仪。\n因君当远发，倚马赠行辞。\n预拟旋归旆，丹青满凤池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53503,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"排闷","author":"汪广洋","text":"布衣不任事，恒似涉风波。\n况值经营际，其如会计何。\n长官忧见骂，小吏厌相过。\n翻忆秋池上，临书换白鹅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53504,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登凤凰台","author":"汪广洋","text":"久游龙虎国，每上凤凰台。\n一水浮衣带，三山落酒杯。\n东南形胜在，空阔画图开。\n有感风云会，从天五马来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53505,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清夜","author":"汪广洋","text":"月林栖羽白，露草啼蛩清。\n秋带银河泻，凉随冰簟生。\n弹琴送逸响，酌酒散幽情。\n赖有同袍者，俱为江海行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53506,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄省中诸老","author":"汪广洋","text":"台衡森列宿，伊迩紫薇垣。\n诸老临清地，匡时在直言。\n醴泉方浩瀚，凤鸟任腾骞。\n我独南征久，年来忆故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53507,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李士良之官宜兴","author":"汪广洋","text":"近美除州牧，多言用旧臣。\n正须宜令德，毋乃为斯民。\n沙暖潮痕浅，城春柳色新。\n应思阳羡路，日日望车尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53508,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬孔都事","author":"汪广洋","text":"一日不趋省，寸心何以安。\n开门偶自适，力疾强加餐。\n广野众星出，高城暝鼓残。\n思君进谒后，归骑北风寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53509,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西施滩","author":"汪广洋","text":"东越国已泯，西施滩尚存。\n天垂芳草地，渔唱夕阳村。\n荇带牵舟楫，罗衣拂酒尊。\n杜鹃缘底事，只管下啼痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴建德南楼","author":"汪广洋","text":"绮席张新宴，华裾纵合欢。\n蔗浆调碧盌，鱼鲙缕冰盘。\n高阁宜开晚，轻衣不受寒。\n坐闻弹锦瑟，凉月在阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53511,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日用张都事游田坟诗韵","author":"汪广洋","text":"命驾来游日，看碑数历年。\n绀云笼净刹，碧草上遗阡。\n野兴三山外，秋声万竹边。\n应逢大小朗，煮茗试新泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53512,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登蒋山望江亭次韵二首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"每到蒋山日，令人老眼青。\n溜泉深处落，独客静中听。\n萝径依禅榻，苔函锁佛经。\n更须临绝顶，一上望江亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53513,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日答郭生诗韵","author":"汪广洋","text":"眺望思弥惬，况当秋序殚。\n微烟澹遥水，落日下平峦。\n每喜疏花发，得逢知己欢。\n壶觞且清话，聊乐复何叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53514,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠历阳令","author":"汪广洋","text":"县宰张公子，能官且好文。\n拟将清白节，报答圣明君。\n抚卷歌秋水，扬舲带夕曛。\n鸡山何处是，西望碧絪缊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53515,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章秋日闻莺","author":"汪广洋","text":"杞树叶半脱，不禁黄鸟啼。\n兴阑缘梦断，愁尽觉声低。\n南浦凉云薄，章江碧草萋。\n终非旧闻处，花发凤池西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53516,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卜明府","author":"汪广洋","text":"联辔出东野，长歌赠贰车。\n要知勤庶绩，方不负新除。\n好日开春酒，晴江上白鱼。\n明当有嘉政，取次为君书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53517,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李员外往临川议事","author":"汪广洋","text":"四牡动鸣镳，双旌拥使轺。\n省郎临政日，郡吏候来朝。\n送别当秋野，行吟过浦桥。\n烦将经国事，细语霍嫖姚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53518,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠周卿往临江","author":"汪广洋","text":"秋风动庭闱，游子赋无衣。\n谩托青云想，空令白日飞。\n江流来浩荡，树色带依微。\n西郡多朋达，停骖候远归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53519,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉旨咏五明马","author":"汪广洋","text":"九尺风神异，五花春色明。\n璠玙装络脑，珠贝结繁缨。\n雾滃来天沼，星驰过石城。\n千金逢伯乐，一顾未为轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53520,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答友人夜直诗韵","author":"汪广洋","text":"碧树秋声满，彤庭月色高。\n故人待清漏，永夜直东曹。\n听履鸣瑶佩，飞觞看宝刀。\n犹能临素壁，和雾点霜毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53521,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴","author":"汪广洋","text":"野兴自不浅，秋声何复来。\n树深寒易作，门僻晓慵开。\n拟写江掩恨，惭非宋玉才。\n素琴多雅调，稍理向池台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53522,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合江亭晚眺","author":"汪广洋","text":"二水澄白练，一亭延素秋。\n聊为庾公啸，因效子长游。\n月色泻尊俎，剑光冲斗牛。\n更须舒老眼，西北有高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53523,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"汪广洋","text":"默坐百感集，高城初漏过。\n起行明月底，静看落叶多。\n候虫啼砌石，凉蛤沸池波。\n怀抱无由写，其如此夜何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"汪广洋","text":"七夕无盈刻，双星有定期。\n明河徵素色，灵鹊待多时。\n帘幕清歌度，罘罳结绮垂。\n美人新月底，拜语向蛛丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友生 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"幕府求才俊，髯参早见招。\n春江怀解缆，秋日喜联镳。\n白纻辞偏好，青云路正遥。\n十年戎马内，老气逸天骄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友生 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"与子十年故，去乡千里遥。\n艰难悲晋楚，慷慨薄云霄。\n起舞月光出，长歌露气飘。\n秋风玉关外，曾是老班超。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋江上停云送周生省亲","author":"汪广洋","text":"落日敞朱楼，江云暝不流。\n密依荆树暗，遥带晋陵秋。\n鸟外生归思，天涯念旧游。\n亦知亲舍近，早晚放孤舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送高廷琇之扬州","author":"汪广洋","text":"君家贤伯仲，理棹上扬州。\n一别悬知远，几时还共游。\n暮云生楚树，凉雨过䢴沟。\n后夜遥相忆，月高人倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李府尹","author":"汪广洋","text":"太守承新泽，诸公赠好辞。\n近闻初度日，正值上官时。\n园棣联春萼，庭梧长玉枝。\n比来歌二美，聊以慰相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送州判刘秩之徐州","author":"汪广洋","text":"彭城必争地，兵后竟如何。\n庶事烦经略，群情在抚摩。\n江云垂暝远，楚树入秋多。\n感慨临岐别，持觞发啸歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题凝翠轩","author":"汪广洋","text":"都会称江左，山川胜洛中。\n小轩开静日，积翠倚晴空。\n云卧巢松鹤，泉流饮涧虹。\n公馀宜引眺，秀色在心胸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"学静斋为镇抚易贵赋","author":"汪广洋","text":"唯我习静者，登君学静斋。\n竹阴笼小径，草色上闲阶。\n默对芳春景，渐消远客怀。\n吟馀清兴惬，鸣鸟更喈喈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"交州南楼","author":"汪广洋","text":"久负烟霞想，多为汗漫游。\n谁知岭外客，独上斗南楼。\n碧树藏蛮逻，清歌发蜑舟。\n西山馀爽气，早晚是新秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南新秋","author":"汪广洋","text":"繁吹动秋声，天凉海气清。\n深杯行竹叶，高枕傲桃笙。\n晚树依微出，晴波潋滟明。\n醉来还自得，觉我在蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闻莺","author":"汪广洋","text":"旭日丽宝树，微风生绮罗。\n竹深凉翠合，莺转落红多。\n岑寂怀人处，间关奈尔何。\n岭南天气好，二月转清和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方塘","author":"汪广洋","text":"轻烟浮野色，浅绿动秋渠。\n好鸟时飞至，令人心自如。\n浣花红日净，梦草碧窗虚。\n更有於中趣，闲来学钓鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜友得除","author":"汪广洋","text":"拜命荣何极，来旬事绝难。\n中天移列宿，西郡得能官。\n露重兰蕤碧，风高柏子寒。\n思君旧游地，谁与更盘桓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋对雨","author":"汪广洋","text":"百年多胜游，得意在中秋。\n月白露华满，天空海气浮。\n深杯行绿酒，短棹发沧州。\n此夜兼风雨，令人有所愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘外史题诗见山堂兼美同行诸友 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"□□刘外史，今代蔡中郎。\n结屋缘溪曲，开轩待月光。\n竹围琴席润，花傍酒船香。\n见说陂南去，何时有报章。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘外史题诗见山堂兼美同行诸友 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"酝藉稽中散，才名阮仲容。\n良时不易得，有暇即相从。\n溪静鱼依藻，天凉鹤在松。\n坐开金谷酒，酌向宝珠峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜平苏州兼得家书二首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"五年烦睿思，万国系安危。\n训武修文日，擒充戮窦时。\n卿云垂烂漫，彩凤下葳蕤。\n更喜河南北，壶浆待六师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜平苏州兼得家书二首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"京国书来报，苏州事已完。\n慈亲膺寿考，诸弟喜平安。\n稽首瞻天舞，焚香对日观。\n圣恩何以答，铭刻在忠肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看山","author":"汪广洋","text":"沿江多好山，孤绝势难扳。\n鹰隼飞腾上，云霞出没间。\n崖巅摩太古，石脚浸苍顽。\n东下连沧海，如渠有几关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过落星石","author":"汪广洋","text":"今夕兴不浅，月高湖水平。\n稳乘白鹞子，直到豫章城。\n山酒开孤寂，洞箫闻数声。\n匡庐青未了，相近眼偏明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过昌邑山","author":"汪广洋","text":"解带临江渚，移舟近薜萝。\n岸沙留醉卧，山鸟答行歌。\n浪静天容阔，云低雨脚多。\n年年事行役，此地屡经过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青山","author":"汪广洋","text":"独立眺空明，夜凉河汉横。\n林疏容月色，溪静纳泉声。\n兴到诗堪咏，愁宽酒易倾。\n徘徊山露下，云水有馀情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过西省","author":"汪广洋","text":"云集款芳渚，星言送去轺。\n敢烦君命重，不惮宦途遥。\n故邑将期到，西山复见招。\n簿书如易就，当别在明朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白发","author":"汪广洋","text":"圣朝频见取，报效近如何。\n名厕清时列，忧深白发多。\n江淮移省檄，邹鲁尚弦歌。\n自愧才疏浅，那能遂抚摩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":53549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]